{"c":[{"name":"20261005T173412Z-c65516aec96de620","text":"G2: every goal write passes goals/gates.ts (never-typed, misfit + numberFieldMisfit, Ask's verifyWrites Jev question); lowerGoal is async and needs askJev + ledger; with no Jev a goal writes no copied value, so desk tests pass test/goal-desk.ts standInJev.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T173413Z-41b9cc8b0f0c0c83","text":"G2: drafts.ts restates() (skip Jev for a restated sentence) is a closed-frame clause-suffix rule; two reviews found 5 bypasses in looser versions (token sets, 'Avoid saying', 'NOT saying', 'provided'); never widen it by adding words.","type":"note"}]}
